{"2988620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "I Hate My Waifu Streamer", "steam_appid": 2988620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988620/extras/55b5b8e345ec3636b429baf6ed6c29d5.poster.avif?t=1777562389\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988620/extras/55b5b8e345ec3636b429baf6ed6c29d5.webm?t=1777562389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988620/extras/55b5b8e345ec3636b429baf6ed6c29d5.mp4?t=1777562389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey there! Thanks for dropping by! I'm here to provide you with the best content, and I'm grateful for every subscriber, no matter if they donate or not. Ha-ha! I'm all about having fun, chatting, enjoying treats, and playing games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988620/extras/ede821dc7d2ee196f64ee856b6f6d14d.poster.avif?t=1777562389\" width=600 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988620/extras/ede821dc7d2ee196f64ee856b6f6d14d.webm?t=1777562389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988620/extras/ede821dc7d2ee196f64ee856b6f6d14d.mp4?t=1777562389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But, don't underestimate me. I have my limits and might react differently to negativity. Boo hoo... So, let's keep it positive and have an awesome time together. Whether you're meeting me online or in person, let's make it a blast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💗 The first  visual novel with simulation elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💗 The only streamer who will pay attention to you if you put in enough effort</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💗 Money increases the streamer's interest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💗 Your comments, especially donations during streams, will set you apart from nerds and broke-asses<br>💗 She will unbox your gifts during the stream</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💗 Ask provocative questions—the ones that are always on your mind<br>💗 Don't abuse the dark web; in fact, it's better not to access it at all  <br>💗 Mio can become your real girlfriend (yes, even you have a chance), or you might feel offended by her unavailability and end up having her targeted by haters (what if that actually helps?)<br>💗 Every action you take in the game will lead you to different endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come and join my stream!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988620/extras/52da47d2c9a74d89dd837fb4681ed6b7.avif?t=1777562389\" width=600 height=210 /></span>  </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988620/extras/55b5b8e345ec3636b429baf6ed6c29d5.poster.avif?t=1777562389\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988620/extras/55b5b8e345ec3636b429baf6ed6c29d5.webm?t=1777562389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988620/extras/55b5b8e345ec3636b429baf6ed6c29d5.mp4?t=1777562389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey there! Thanks for dropping by! I'm here to provide you with the best content, and I'm grateful for every subscriber, no matter if they donate or not. Ha-ha! I'm all about having fun, chatting, enjoying treats, and playing games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988620/extras/ede821dc7d2ee196f64ee856b6f6d14d.poster.avif?t=1777562389\" width=600 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988620/extras/ede821dc7d2ee196f64ee856b6f6d14d.webm?t=1777562389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988620/extras/ede821dc7d2ee196f64ee856b6f6d14d.mp4?t=1777562389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But, don't underestimate me. I have my limits and might react differently to negativity. Boo hoo... So, let's keep it positive and have an awesome time together. Whether you're meeting me online or in person, let's make it a blast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💗 The first  visual novel with simulation elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💗 The only streamer who will pay attention to you if you put in enough effort</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💗 Money increases the streamer's interest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💗 Your comments, especially donations during streams, will set you apart from nerds and broke-asses<br>💗 She will unbox your gifts during the stream</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💗 Ask provocative questions—the ones that are always on your mind<br>💗 Don't abuse the dark web; in fact, it's better not to access it at all  <br>💗 Mio can become your real girlfriend (yes, even you have a chance), or you might feel offended by her unavailability and end up having her targeted by haters (what if that actually helps?)<br>💗 Every action you take in the game will lead you to different endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come and join my stream!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988620/extras/52da47d2c9a74d89dd837fb4681ed6b7.avif?t=1777562389\" width=600 height=210 /></span>  </p>", "short_description": "Get the streamer's attention at any cost before someone else does. Write comments, chat, and make donations to your waifu, but do not dare to hate her!", "supported_languages": "English, Russian, Japanese, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Korean, German, Vietnamese", "reviews": "“The game doesn't shy away from difficult themes. The different routes are remarkably varied, with some being deeply emotional or intense. Some of the most gripping story paths spiral out of control, fueled by mob mentality within the world of social media and entertainment.”<br>CONSOLEWARS<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988620/f6b2f33d0af2a97327af50613d9e24f40682d645/header.jpg?t=1777562389", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988620/6d9374d1cdd946fd93e1b225c74f640bfaa37fe7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777562389", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988620/6d9374d1cdd946fd93e1b225c74f640bfaa37fe7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1777562389", "website": "https://nozorigames.ru", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.2 GHz<br></li><li>